      "filename": "Stamp 1944 Greece MiNr0474 mt B002b.jpg",
      "title": "File:Stamp 1944 Greece MiNr0474 mt B002b.jpg",
      "url": "https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/8/81/Stamp_1944_Greece_MiNr0474_mt_B002b.jpg",
